# NYSEG AutoPay Case Study

This case study explores a real customer experience from my time supporting billing at NYSEG (New York State Electric & Gas). It focuses on confusion caused by the coexistence of two different autopay systems—one linked to SAP/CRMB and another called "Recurring Payments."

The file `NYSEG Autopay Case Study.md` walks through:
- The technical problem
- Customer impact
- Suggested solutions
- Skills demonstrated
